---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service — Pinello"
  description="Terms of service for Pinello Chrome extension."
  canonical="https://amrita-labs.com/pinello/terms/"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 prose prose-invert prose-sm">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Terms of Service — Pinello</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400"><strong>Effective Date</strong>: 2026-06-15 · <strong>Last Updated</strong>: 2026-07-31</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">1. Acceptance</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">By installing or using Pinello ("the Extension"), you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, uninstall the Extension.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">2. Description of Service</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Pinello is a Chrome extension that scores Pinterest pins across 5 dimensions — image quality, board fit, title SEO, description, and hashtags — in real time, with AI-powered rewrite suggestions.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">3. Free and Paid Tiers</h2>
    <ul class="text-gray-300">
      <li><strong>Free tier</strong>: Includes feed score badges, pin stats on hover, and core balanced scoring inside the Pinterest pin creator. No account required.</li>
      <li><strong>Pro tier</strong>: Adds CSV export, extra scoring modes, AI rewrite features, and other paid capabilities shown in-product.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Some free and paid limits or feature bundles may change over time. Structural scoring features may remain free while certain advanced features require Pro access.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">4. Acceptable Use</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">You agree NOT to:</p>
    <ul class="text-gray-300">
      <li>Use automated tools to bypass rate limits or free-tier caps</li>
      <li>Reverse-engineer the scoring algorithm or API</li>
      <li>Use the Extension for spam or automated pin generation</li>
      <li>Resell access to the Extension's API</li>
      <li>Submit content that violates applicable laws</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">5. AI-Generated Content</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Rewrite suggestions are generated by AI (GPT-4.1-mini via Azure OpenAI). You are responsible for reviewing and editing any AI-generated text before publishing. We do not guarantee that AI suggestions will improve pin performance or reach.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <ul class="text-gray-300">
      <li>The Extension and its code are owned by Amrita Labs</li>
      <li>Pin content you create is yours — we claim no ownership</li>
      <li>AI-generated suggestions are provided as-is; no copyright claim is made on AI outputs</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">7. Payment and Refunds</h2>
    <ul class="text-gray-300">
      <li>Current Pro access is offered as a one-time USD purchase for lifetime access unless a different offer is clearly shown at checkout</li>
      <li>Payments are processed by ExtensionPay / Stripe or another disclosed payment provider</li>
      <li>Refund requests are handled case-by-case — request via <a href="mailto:hello@amrita-labs.com" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">hello@amrita-labs.com</a></li>
      <li>If we introduce subscriptions or other billing models later, those terms will be disclosed before purchase</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">8. Privacy</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">See our <a href="/pinello/privacy/" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> for details on data collection, use, and your rights.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">9. Disclaimers</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">THE EXTENSION IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND. We do not guarantee accuracy of scores, that AI suggestions will improve pin reach, uninterrupted operation, or compatibility with future Pinterest updates.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Our total liability for any claim is limited to the amount you paid us in the 12 months preceding the claim, or $50, whichever is greater. We are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">11. Dispute Resolution</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">Disputes will be resolved through binding arbitration in Ontario, Canada. For EU users: this does not affect your statutory consumer protection rights.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">12. Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">We may update these Terms at any time. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance. If you disagree, uninstall the Extension.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">13. Termination</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">We may terminate your access if you violate these Terms. You may terminate by uninstalling the Extension.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">14. Governing Law</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">These Terms are governed by the laws of Ontario, Canada.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-10">15. Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300">For questions: <a href="mailto:hello@amrita-labs.com" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">hello@amrita-labs.com</a></p>
  </article>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-12 flex gap-6 text-xs text-gray-500">
    <a href="/pinello/" class="hover:text-gray-400">← Back to Pinello</a>
    <a href="/pinello/privacy/" class="hover:text-gray-400">Privacy Policy</a>
  </div>
</Base>
